<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1646) <span class="when">Oct 16, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>&#8220;What color is this?&#8221; reads P3-D65 and Rec.2020 EXRs correctly.</b> An EXR whose header states P3-D65 or Rec.2020 primaries was offered linear Rec.709; it&#8217;s now offered linear P3-D65 or linear Rec.2020, in ACES 1.x and 2.0 configs. File and space names no longer match &#8220;raw&#8221;, &#8220;data&#8221; or &#8220;AP0&#8221; inside longer words (&#8220;metadata&#8221;, &#8220;straw&#8221;).</li>
<li><b>The color helper and Apply to All are buttons now.</b> In the color pipeline pop-up, &#8220;Check this file&#8217;s color&#8230;&#8221; and &#8220;Apply to All&#8221; are pill buttons instead of link text, orange when the file doesn&#8217;t match its setting.</li>
</ul>
